## Updating releases

Version and download URLs are driven by plain text files (no HTML edits required for most releases):

1. Set the version in `public.version` or `beta.version`
2. Keep URL templates in `win.pub` / `mac.pub` / `linux.pub` (and `*.beta`) using `{public.version}` or `{beta.version}`
3. Optionally update `public.change` / `beta.change` markdown for the changelog modal

Download buttons include fallback hrefs with the current version so links still work if JavaScript fails. After bumping a version file, update those fallbacks in `index.html`, `public.html`, and `beta.html` (or rely on JS hydration after deploy).

## Local preview

This is a static site. Open any HTML file in a browser, or serve the folder:

```bash
npx serve .
```

## Deploy

Pushes to `main` deploy via GitHub Pages (`.github/workflows/static.yml`). Custom domain is configured in `CNAME`.
